    <string name="section_about">Privacy and health</string>
    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Cycle data stays in app-private storage by default. Selia Cycles has no ads or analytics. Optional Google sync sends your Google account identifier and only period dates and flow to Firebase; notes, mood, symptoms, weight, temperature, sleep and intimacy stay local. Manual backups use AES-GCM encryption with your password. Health Connect is read only and used only when you tap Import.</string>
